ic/images/wow/icons/small/spell_holy_divinespirit.jpg\");'></ins><del></del></span>\n                            <a style='color: white !important' href='?spell=560395'> Rippling Resilience </a> <br />\n                            <span> <span style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ripple</span> now delays 30% of incoming direct Physical Damage to allies within 15 yds for it's duration, instead taking it over 5 seconds. </span><br /></span></td></tr></table><!--?806301:1:1:80-->",
